firmware-studio (1.0.4) stable; urgency=medium

  * Ship Studio DAC8x firmware v0.0.3 (studiodac8x-0.0.3.hex), replacing
    v0.0.2. Fixes the SMBus sequential-read off-by-one (a multi-byte read
    duplicated the first byte and dropped the last) and a command ring-buffer
    overrun; adds the DAC register-peek window (regmap 0xF0-0xF3).
  * Add studio-dac8x-status: report per-chip PLL lock and audio-present
    (real audio vs digital silence) via the peek window.
  * Depend on i2c-tools (used by studio-dac8x-status).

 -- HiFiBerry <support@hifiberry.com>  Fri, 10 Jul 2026 10:30:00 +0000

